WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.100
Switch the composer to Agent. The workspace pill shows the folder its file tools are confined to.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.800
Agent mode keeps Shell Access on. Turn on Plan mode: the agent investigates read-only first.

3
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.100
Describe the task.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.700
The agent reads the project and proposes a checklist plan.

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.600
Click Approve & Run. Only now can it write files and run commands.

6
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.500
Each edit and command joins the trace as it finishes, ending with the test run.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.700
Open an edit in the trace: its diff shows the lines the agent added.

8
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.600
Open the test run in the trace: the new healthz test passes with the existing ones.
